{"body":{"text":["*The engine, the interface and the stores were merged onto main and the site published (19/25); the expressions as uses, the buffer, the interface and the site on the engine, the stores in strata and components declared in their holons, the steps before these, are built, as each part says. The chassis was broken away at the author's word (20/19), and the components made plain functions over `io`, rendered and laid out by it (21/57, 21/72), built; the author's review of them is next (21/98), then the git integration (19/19). The order is the session's. Proposed.*"]},"id":"1M86J2QWG2VF00H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
